"text":"こども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というでんとうてきなぶんかなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしがしっかりしないと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がくやがようちえんみたいになってしまうという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうじさいねんしょうのききかんりのうりょくで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにりっぱにせいちょうしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたざかのほごしゃとして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みまもってね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・レッスンで五期生にアドバイスをしている姿を見て、頼もしい先輩だなぁと思いました！（by じゃーまね）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えぴそーどがね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいねんしょうぐみにたいするものじゃないのよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんだけたのもしいのりなし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカにもあどばいすをください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__96321575_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・クリスマスパーティーでのプレゼント交換で渡辺のプレゼントが当たって、お鍋のセットをもらいましたが、まだ食べられていません！！（by よーこ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいしゅうつかってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ならわかるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだつかってないことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなにどうどうというのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただしいのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカはふかくかんがえました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けっか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーこだからゆるされるってことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとつかってあげてください〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さもなければ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"退散のきりふだまただします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近「やっほ〜」と話しかけてくださるのが嬉しすぎるのと、何かを質問した時にどんな時も優しく説明してくださったり、同い年なのが本当に本当に心強いです！\n莉奈さんがいらっしゃるから大丈夫だという安心感と尊敬の気持ちでいっぱいです！（by さかい）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さかいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りなしはね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じんせいごしゅうめなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だまっててごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さかいのきもちを４かいけいけんしてるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっとくりょくあるんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__96321573_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おとなりなしなタレコミおおしですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカとはこいたずらごっこであそんでくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やさしいおねいさんというかんじです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいたいめかくしされたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__96321571_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とさかフォークされたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいまじんりなし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__96321572_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばぶみびじゅで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとわらいなよと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうせいえがおにさせられたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じつはまつだにつぐポカのつかいてだったりします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんかいのしんぐるでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいりなしがたくさんみれるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねんしょうぐみでありながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたざかを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひっぱっていってほしいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りなし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらためて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんじょうびおめでとう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__96337945.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカはうどんでもたべようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"}}